# HOMESPUN: proof that the Alien can be earned. The three world proofs
# already play the whole gold game from the title; this one starts from the
# camp such a run ends with (six buds, three huts, every anvil and study,
# the Tumbleweed whole) so it stays quick. From there the demo player does
# what players do: gathers odds at Kit's chests, buys tonics from a noodler
# on the way out, hunts Mawbo across the Wilds until it falls six times in
# one trip, and flies home with the Grinning Idol. Trips that run dry fade
# home and it tries again, with real time passing between spells of play.
seed 202
game homespun
wait 5
cheat newgame 202
wait 5
cheat plants 6
cheat huts 3 3
cheat anvils 63 7
cheat lab 1 3
cheat smoke 1 6
cheat bins 2 2
cheat research 63
cheat parts 7
cheat loom 1
cheat pipe 1
cheat res glints 12000
cheat res bars 1000
cheat res jerky 25
expect idol == 0
botloop escapes >= 1 1500 3600 300000
expect goals & 4
expect idol_escapes == 1
expect escapes == 1
